    "ingredients": [
      "Sure, here's a detailed explanation of the recipe for \"Leek and Ramp Veloute\":",
      "3 leeks, trimmed and sliced",
      "1 bunch of ramps, cleaned and chopped",
      "2 cloves of garlic, minced",
      "4 cups of vegetable or chicken stock",
      "1 cup of heavy cream",
      "1 tbsp of olive oil",
      "Salt and pepper to taste",
      "King oyster mushrooms, sliced",
      "Torn bread for garnish"
    ],
    "instructions": [
      "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the leeks and garlic and sauté for about 5 minutes, or until the leeks are soft and translucent.",
      "Add the ramps to the pot and sauté for another 2-3 minutes, or until they are wilted.",
      "Pour in the vegetable or chicken stock and bring the mixture to a boil. Reduce the heat and let it simmer for about 20-25 minutes, or until the vegetables are very tender.",
      "Use an immersion blender or transfer the soup to a blender and puree until smooth.",
      "Stir in the heavy cream and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "In a separate pan, sauté the sliced king oyster mushrooms until golden brown.",
      "Serve the Leek and Ramp Veloute in bowls, garnished with the sautéed king oyster mushrooms and torn bread on top.",
      "Enjoy your delicious Leek and Ramp Veloute with a deliciously earthy and creamy flavor!"
    ],
